# Environment variable conventions
# - Copy to .env for local development.
# - All VITE_* variables are baked into the JS bundle at build time
#   (readable in browser + SSR). Never put secrets in VITE_* variables —
#   this is a public repository and .env files are tracked by git.
# - Server-only non-secret config goes into wrangler.json env.*.vars.
# - Secrets go into `wrangler secret put <NAME>` (never committed).
